# Host minion turns (src/turn-launch.ts TURN_SLICE) and ultra reviews run here, under citadel.slice (MemoryHigh=19G,
# MemoryMax=22G for everything Citadel runs), beside citadel-builds.slice (ships, kit-sync, fast-verify),
# citadel-heavy.slice (the tests, browsers and builds a turn runs) and citadel-taskmasters.slice.
#
# Turns slow down; they are not capped or killed for running short (#1338, the memory design in the scheme's shared
# folder: reports/memory-kills-2026-11-20.md). Cara, 2026-11-20: "I want to be able to just kick off as many minions as
# I want ... if the individual jobs take longer ... thats ok"; "Its the tests/heavy slots/builds that are the thing that
# hits performance, we should limit/off load those, not stop minions from starting"; on #1335's choices page "B: no
# kill on the turns' line: Go" and "C: protect turns instead of capping them: Go".
#
# No MemoryHigh: on 2026-11-20 this slice sat at its own line (10G, then #1328's 16G, which Cara called "a stopgap")
# and the kernel's throttle there stalled every turn in it at 99-100% memory pressure for up to 11 minutes, while
# citadel.slice had room; CachyOS's oomd rule then killed 23 turns. Without it, turns grow into citadel.slice's room.
# MemoryLow=8G instead: when citadel.slice's MemoryHigh or MemoryMax has to reclaim, it takes from ships, heavy
# commands, containers and caches first, and from turns only beyond their first 8G (about 15 turns at their usual
# 350-650M). The kernel honours it without root (memory_recursiveprot), measured 2026-11-20 with a parent's
# memory.high at 300M over two 253M holders: the protected one kept all 253M in RAM, the other was cut to 45M.
# Reclaim the whole box starts ignores it (user.slice above has no MemoryLow; that one would need Cody).
# No MemoryMax: it would OOM-kill turns. systemd-oomd's rules for this slice (none of its own) and the ones above it:
# deploy/oomd.md. Container turns run in their own units (src/claude-link.ts CONTAINER_MEMORY), outside this reserve.
[Unit]
Description=Host turns of Citadel

[Slice]
MemoryLow=8G
